---
layout: default
title: JRuby Support Services
---

<%= render PageIntro.new(
  section_id: "services-intro",
  require_path: "headius/support/packages",
  heading: "Support Packages",
  body: "Every tier connects you directly to the engineers who build JRuby. No ticket queues, no call centres, no escalation paths to nowhere. The only difference is how much of our time you need."
) %>

<%= render Section.new(
  section_id: "professional",
  highlighted: true
) do %>
  <%= render Columns.new(
  ) do %>
    <%= render Column.new(
    ) do %>
      <%= render CodeBlock.new(
        language: "ruby",
        framed: false
      ) do %>
class Professional < Support
  # For teams getting started with JRuby
  # or running smaller deployments that
  # need a safety net.
      <% end %>
      <%= render Heading.new(
        text: "Professional Support",
        level: 2
      ) %>
      <%= render MarkdownBlock.new(
      ) do %>
A direct line to the people who write the runtime. When something doesn't behave the way you expect, you email us and someone who actually knows the answer responds. Not a junior support rep reading from a script — a core JRuby developer.

You also get advance notice of every release before it lands, including security patches, breaking changes, and new features. No surprises on a Friday afternoon.
      <% end %>
    <% end %>
    <%= render Card.new(
      variant: "plain"
    ) do %>
      <%= render CodeBlock.new(
        language: "yaml"
      ) do %>
pricing:
  monthly:  "$99/mo"
  yearly:   "$995/yr"  # save 16%
      <% end %>
      <%= render MarkdownBlock.new(
      ) do %>
---
- Priority email to core JRuby developers
- Advance release notifications
- Up to 5 team members
      <% end %>
      <%= render Actions.new(
        actions: [
          {
            label: "Professional.subscribe(:yearly)",
            url: "https://buy.stripe.com/fZe014gtE5Ng1nG4gg",
            target: "",
            style: "primary",
            new_window: true
          },
          {
            label: "Professional.subscribe(:monthly)",
            url: "https://buy.stripe.com/00g4hkcdo0sW2rKaEF",
            target: "",
            style: "ghost",
            new_window: true
          }
        ]
      ) %>
    <% end %>
  <% end %>
<% end %>

<%= render Section.new(
  section_id: "expert",
  highlighted: false
) do %>
  <%= render Columns.new(
  ) do %>
    <%= render Column.new(
    ) do %>
      <%= render CodeBlock.new(
        language: "ruby",
        framed: false
      ) do %>
class Expert < Professional
  # For teams that need faster answers, real-
  # time conversations, and actual fixes
  # not workarounds.
      <% end %>
      <%= render Heading.new(
        text: "Expert Support",
        level: 2
      ) %>
      <%= render MarkdownBlock.new(
      ) do %>
Everything in Professional, plus direct chat with core developers — text, video, or audio, whatever works for your team. Sometimes you need to share a screen and point at the thing that's broken. Up to one hour of live support per month is included.

You also get one priority bug fix per month. Not "we'll look into it" — an actual fix, committed by the person you're talking to. Your issue goes to the front of the queue, and a patch release follows.

**Note: Expert service is billed on a bi-monthly basis (two months at a time) or yearly.**
      <% end %>
    <% end %>
    <%= render Card.new(
      variant: "featured"
    ) do %>
      <%= render CodeBlock.new(
        language: "yaml"
      ) do %>
pricing:
  bimonthly: "$2,999/2mo"
  yearly:    "$16,499/yr"  # 1 month free
      <% end %>
